{"finding_id": "P08-010", "scene_id": "SC959cea4cd47a5799", "row_ids": ["CAT:Oa0f9368daed0e2f03aee", "CAT:O975b195a8c93956ff1c4", "CAT:O32c5af6d147404aca73b", "CAT:O3f8da024a5a58e708cfa", "CAT:O6c46a3463878c0ad785a", "CAT:Ob6652c192efab5679ed3"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[WHEN WAS THE LAST TIME YOU HAD ONE OF THOSE IN YOUR MAW?]\n[COSMO COLLEGE. SECOND YEAR. SUMMER VACATION, 19XX.]\n[WHAT? SERIOUS? YOU'VE NEVER TOLD ME ABOUT THA-]\n[USED TO BE THIS AMAZING TACO TRUCK BY THE BEACH.]\n[WENT THERE PRACTICALLY EVERY DAY!]\n[OH RIGHT, OF COURSE... SOUNDS... YUM...!]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [你上次把那种放进大口是什么时候？]\n  Yiffany: [Cosmo学院。第二年。暑假，19XX。]\n  Tomcat: [什么？当真？你从没跟我说过THA-]\n  Yiffany: [以前海滩边有一辆特别棒的塔可餐车。]\n  Yiffany: [几乎每天都去那儿！]\n  Tomcat: [哦对，当然……听起来……好吃……!]", "proposed_zh": "Tomcat：你上回嘴里尝到这个，是什么时候？\nYiffany：宇宙学院，大二。19XX年的暑假。\nTomcat：什么？真的？你可从没跟我说过这——\nYiffany：那时候海滩边有辆超棒的塔可餐车。我几乎天天去！\nTomcat：哦，对，当然……听着……真香……！", "reason": "Tomcat故意以食物说暧昧话，被餐车解释截断。现译“大口”“THA-”让问句和截话都不成立；保留食物表层与误会空间，不强加更露骨解释。", "evidence_level": "直接文本与连续场景控制证据", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds / TomcatItems.StatFishtaco", "CAT:Oa0f9368daed0e2f03aee", "CAT:O975b195a8c93956ff1c4", "CAT:O32c5af6d147404aca73b", "CAT:O3f8da024a5a58e708cfa", "CAT:O6c46a3463878c0ad785a", "CAT:Ob6652c192efab5679ed3"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support/Tomcat", "characters-primary/Yiffany"], "conditions_branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "controls": [{"line": 3884, "source": "<TomcatItems.StatFishtaco>", "current": "<TomcatItems.StatFishtaco>"}]}, "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only"}
