{"finding_id": "P08-012", "scene_id": "SC691b3a18b7909076", "row_ids": ["CAT:O21b65772d7daa4dbb724", "CAT:Oee5ac96f898f7023edfd", "CAT:O9e08866d24a2a16e2274"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[PLEASE REVIEW THE OPERATION NOTES MORE THOROUGHLY.]\n[GOOD TO KNOW SOME FOLKS ARE PAYING ATTENTION.]\n[THANKS A LOT, BOSSU!]", "current_quote": "  Bossu: [请把行动笔记再仔细通读一遍。]\n  Yiffai: [知道还有人在认真听着，真不错。]\n  Yiffai: [太感谢了，BOSSU！]", "proposed_zh": "Bossu：请把行动笔记再仔细通读一遍。\nYiffai：还好总有人认真做了功课。多谢，Bossu！", "reason": "paying attention承接Bossu认真看行动笔记、纠正Mauser资料，不是“认真听着”外勤说话。保留年轻主角略带揶揄的感谢，不写成全员无能。", "evidence_level": "直接文本与连续场景控制证据", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / Mauser.AreaC_map01_a noselect", "CAT:O21b65772d7daa4dbb724", "CAT:Oee5ac96f898f7023edfd", "CAT:O9e08866d24a2a16e2274"], "reference_keys": ["characters-primary/Yiffai", "characters-support/Bossu"], "conditions_branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "controls": [{"line": 2396, "source": "<Mauser.AreaC_map01_a noselect>", "current": "<Mauser.AreaC_map01_a noselect>"}]}, "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only"}
{"finding_id": "P08-013", "scene_id": "SCb84957d4bbe46c64", "row_ids": ["CAT:O211d32bcfc1ea166f9a9", "CAT:O3ff7c6da1113e0f47ee0", "CAT:O8ffba486b4343ce835c7", "CAT:Oafa2c8f4181a40861975", "CAT:O58d4ef1a57096949cd79", "CAT:Oa34b63c37bc726ad5efe", "CAT:Ob2d039e9b4aa38a03127"], "severity": "B", "category": "idiom", "source_quote": "[INDEED, IT APPEARS THE MINES OF TUTONE HAVE BEEN MINED.]\n[...? WELL SURE, BUT WHAT'S THAT GOTTA DO WITH EXPLOSIONS?]\n[THE EXPLOSIONS FROM THE MINES.]\n[YEAH! IT WAS IN THE MINES, BUT-]\n[WHAT BOSSU MEANS IS THAT THOSE OLD MINERS PLACED]\n[MINES IN THEIR MINES, AS A WAY TO SAY \"THAT'S MINE!\"]\n[WHAT...?! I'LL JUST AVOID THEM, OKAY?! Y-YIFFAI OUT!]", "current_quote": "  Bossu: [确实，看来图托恩的矿山都已经布上了雷。]\n  Yiffai: [……? 好吧，可那跟爆炸有什么关系？]\n  Bossu: [是那些矿区传来的爆炸。]\n  Yiffai: [对啊！那是在矿坑里，但是-]\n  Mauser: [Bossu的意思是，那些老矿工当年在他们自己的矿里埋了地雷，好喊一声\"这是我的！\"]\n\n  Yiffai: [什么……？！那我就躲开它们，行吧？！伊、伊法伊通话完毕！]", "proposed_zh": "Bossu：确实。看来图托恩的矿坑，早就有人“埋雷占矿”了。\nYiffai：……？占矿我懂，可怎么还炸上了？\nBossu：我说的雷，就是会爆炸的地雷。\nYiffai：我知道是地雷！可为什么要埋在矿坑里——\nMauser：Bossu是说，以前的矿工在自家矿坑里埋了地雷，摆明了告诉别人：“这矿归我！”\nYiffai：什么……？！我躲开就是了，行吧？！伊、伊法伊通话完毕！", "reason": "当前首句已经明说“布雷”，主角却继续不懂，Bossu再把mines译回矿区，问答倒转。中文以“埋雷占矿”与“这矿归我”的占有笑点重建解释链，使主角从问爆炸到问为何埋雷；不能照搬英语同形词。此为整段创译方向，仍需二审试读，不能原样自动回填。", "evidence_level": "直接文本与连续场景控制证据", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / BossuDex.ClassicMineWall", "CAT:O211d32bcfc1ea166f9a9", "CAT:O3ff7c6da1113e0f47ee0", "CAT:O8ffba486b4343ce835c7", "CAT:Oafa2c8f4181a40861975", "CAT:O58d4ef1a57096949cd79", "CAT:Oa34b63c37bc726ad5efe", "CAT:Ob2d039e9b4aa38a03127"], "reference_keys": ["world-and-plot/英式用法、双关与语域"], "conditions_branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "controls": [{"line": 3085, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicMineWall>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicMineWall>"}]}, "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only"}
{"finding_id": "P08-014", "scene_id": "SCe3bb6029d395b6a3", "row_ids": ["CAT:Oc2c225656c44ae19718c", "CAT:O035264e976fac2b5f223"], "severity": "B", "category": "idiom", "source_quote": "[YOU'LL HAVE TO FIND SOMEONE LESS PURR- VERTED THAN TOMCAT]\n[TO TELL YOU WHAT THAT SUIT IS FOR, YIFFAI!]", "current_quote": "  Mauser: [你得找个没汤姆猫那么色、那么喵的家伙，给你讲讲这套衣服的用途了，伊法伊！]\n", "proposed_zh": "伊法伊，要想弄清这套衣服是干什么的，你得找个没Tomcat那么色的来问！", "reason": "purr-verted是针对猫的perverted双关，不独立表示“那么喵”的性格属性。当前并列形容词破坏意思，宜先保住熟人挖苦；中文猫双关若不能自然建立，不强凑。", "evidence_level": "直接文本与连续场景控制证据", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / TomcatItems.KoboBody", "CAT:Oc2c225656c44ae19718c", "CAT:O035264e976fac2b5f223"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support/Tomcat"], "conditions_branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "controls": [{"line": 4233, "source": "<TomcatItems.KoboBody>", "current": "<TomcatItems.KoboBody>"}, {"line": 4247, "source": "### Elf ###", "current": "### Elf ###"}]}, "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only"}
{"finding_id": "P08-015", "scene_id": "SC02a295fdd4ce3288", "row_ids": ["CAT:O92f5dbaabaf35d253fc3", "CAT:Od2fe21f56accd9875e53", "CAT:Oc91c83e4cdc8b678f7ca"], "severity": "A", "category": "gameplay", "source_quote": "[IN ORDER TO USE A KEYCARD, ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS]\n[WALK INTO AN ENERGY DOOR WHILE HOLDING ONE.]\n[YOU CAN OPEN DOORS UP TO THE LEVEL DISPLAYED ON THEM!]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [要使用门卡，只需要带着卡走向能量门就行。]\n\n  Tomcat: [可打开等级不高于门上所标数字的门！]", "proposed_zh": "使用门卡很简单：身上带着卡，直接走向能量门就行。门卡标的是它能开启的最高门禁等级！", "reason": "up to level displayed on them指门卡可开到其标示等级的门。当前“等级不高于门上所标数字的门”成了门与自身等级比较，丢掉卡片上限，误导玩法。关联本包Keycard3 UI“至3级”可交叉佐证。", "evidence_level": "直接文本与连续场景控制证据", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard2", "CAT:O92f5dbaabaf35d253fc3", "CAT:Od2fe21f56accd9875e53", "CAT:Oc91c83e4cdc8b678f7ca"], "reference_keys": ["world-and-plot/I04"], "conditions_branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "controls": [{"line": 4312, "source": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard2>", "current": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard2>"}]}, "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only"}
